On Thursday at 1500GMT, Matt Spinler from IBM will be giving a
presentation on Machine Readable Workbooks (MRW).  He will give
background and history on the concept, the current usage within
OpenPower machines and the plans from the IBM team on incorporating
them into the OpenBMC firmware design.

When: Thursday 2016-08-25 @ 1500GMT (10am CDT).
      See http://goo.gl/L1aRwU for conversion to other timezones.

Conference Call: 1-888-426-6840 passcode 99568085
      See https://goo.gl/or2uaP for alternative (non-US) numbers.

Presentation: https://apps.na.collabserv.com/meetings/join?id=3D4792-2407
      Passcode: openbmc

This is intended to be the first in a series of technical design
discussions and working meetings.  Please send an email to me or the
list if there are other topics you desire to discuss or share at future
events.

